>
	<h2>Hello, I'm Siva</h2>

	<p>
		I'm a technology professional with over 14 years of experience
		across IT infrastructure, enterprise software, product management
		and technology solutions. Over the years, I've had the opportunity
		to work across different technology domains, collaborate with
		diverse teams and engage with customers and technology leaders
		across the globe.
	</p>

	<p>
		Currently, I work as a Product Manager at Vembu Technologies,
		where I focus on data protection, backup and disaster recovery,
		and cyber resilience solutions. My role involves understanding
		customer challenges, defining product direction, working closely
		with engineering and business teams, and translating complex
		technical capabilities into meaningful solutions.
	</p>

	<h2>My Professional Journey</h2>

	<p>
		My journey in technology has given me exposure to several areas,
		including IT infrastructure, virtualization, cloud technologies,
		enterprise backup, disaster recovery and cybersecurity.
		I have also had the opportunity to take on leadership
		responsibilities, manage teams and work with customers ranging
		from IT administrators to CTOs and business leaders.
	</p>

	<p>
		Over time, my interests have evolved beyond technology
		implementation into product strategy, business thinking,
		customer experience and the broader challenges of building
		successful technology products.
	</p>

	<h2>What Interests Me</h2>

	<p>
		I'm particularly interested in the intersection of technology,
		business and innovation. I enjoy exploring how emerging
		technologies can solve real-world problems and how organisations
		can make better decisions when adopting and implementing them.
	</p>

	<p>
		Some of the areas I frequently explore and write about include:
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li>Product Management and Product Strategy</li>
		<li>Data Protection, Backup and Disaster Recovery</li>
		<li>Cybersecurity and Cyber Resilience</li>
		<li>Cloud Computing and IT Infrastructure</li>
		<li>Artificial Intelligence and Emerging Technologies</li>
		<li>Digital Transformation and Business Innovation</li>
		<li>Leadership, Team Building and Customer Experience</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Why This Platform?</h2>

	<p>
		I believe knowledge becomes more valuable when it is shared.
		This platform is my space to share perspectives, practical
		experiences, technology reviews, product insights and lessons
		learned throughout my professional journey.
	</p>

	<p>
		I also plan to share webinars, presentations, discussions
		and independent perspectives on emerging technologies and
		their impact on businesses and society.
	</p>

	<p>
		My intention is to keep things practical, insightful and
		meaningful rather than simply adding to the noise of the
		technology world.
	</p>

	<h2>Let's Connect</h2>

	<p>
		I'm always interested in connecting with technology
		professionals, product leaders, entrepreneurs and people
		who enjoy exchanging ideas and perspectives.
	</p>

	<p>
		Whether it's a discussion about technology, product strategy,
		business challenges or an interesting new idea, I'd be
		happy to connect.
	</p>

	<p>
		Thanks for stopping by. I hope you find something useful here.
	</p>
